        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "warning",
        "description": "Use HashMap or HashSet for keys that require structural equality. Effect compares plain objects and arrays by value, while native Map and Set compare object keys by reference. A newly constructed equal key therefore misses the native collection's stored entry. Keep native collections for deliberate instance identity. Values created with Equal.byReference retain that identity behavior.",
